@startuml ref-composite
!include _style.puml
title Composite - GoF Reference Structure\n(Source: Gamma, Helm, Johnson, Vlissides. Design Patterns. Addison-Wesley, 1995)
interface Component {
  +operation()
  +add(Component)
  +remove(Component)
  +getChild(int)
}
class Leaf {
  +operation()
}
class Composite {
  +operation()
  +add(Component)
  +remove(Component)
}
Component <|.. Leaf
Component <|.. Composite
Composite o--> "children *" Component
note bottom of Composite : Leaf and Composite treated\nuniformly through Component
@enduml
